= Suspicious Movements

Over the previous days, we have noticed strange movements from the Fasci, <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Squadrismo<span class="wide_tooltip-tip">Thugs mainly from the Fasci and PNF.</span></span>, and oher right-wing organizations which support [+ pnf_leader +]  as a influx of troops have amassed in 5 small towns near Central <span style="color: #008C45;">**It**</span><span style="color: #E5E4E2;">**a**</span><span style="color: #CD212A;">**ly**</span>, supposedly due to them being some sort of rallying points for some type of plot, with some also assemblying in Perugia claiming it was the headquarters of their <span style="color: [+ pnf_colour +];">fascist</span> revolution.

More concerningly, armories have been raided and weapons have mysteriously dissapeared from the stockpiles of weapons the Regio Esercito has, suggesting [+ pnf_leader +] is plotting something, and with the time left we have, we should start to try to be prepared for a possible move from the Fasc-

